    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d155">

                <pb facs="0240" n="218" xml:id="pg218"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">399.10–UPU/1–2551:
                    Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Egypt</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cairo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-01-25T17:00:00+02:00">January 25, 1951—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>776. From Redding. Deptel 711, January 24.
                    Situation complicated last night by position Chinese Communists who arrived and
                    stated president committee they would take seat and would refuse to leave until
                    forced out by physical violence. We view this as insult to committee. This
                    morning we arranged Nationalists be present in meeting room too. Then arranged
                    delay of meeting while try to work out settlement. Meeting to continue this
                    afternoon. On advice Embassy here if Communists continue their present position
                    and flout decision of committee will move to adjourn meeting as having become
                    impotent to enforce its decisions; will be supported in this by Brazil and
                    Argentine possibly others but do not know yet. Yugoslavia wavering in Communist
                    group and may abstain. UK telephoning London for new instructions.
                    [Redding.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
